    "### Dimensionality Reduction Visualization\n",
    "\n",
    "Visualizing the results of dimensionality reduction techniques:\n"
   ],
   "id": "da732275ab478468"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {},
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "# Visualize dimensionality reduction results\n",
